ref_dict.lem:harmonic-SS:
\begin{lem}\label{lem:harmonic-SS}
Let
\[
H_\ell(N) := \sum_{\substack{n\le N\\ \omega(n)=\Omega(n)=\ell}} \frac1n.
\]Then for every $0<\eta<1$ we have
\begin{equation}\label{eq:H-ell-lower}
  H_\ell(N) \gg_\eta \frac{(\log\log N)^\ell}{\ell!}
  \qquad (N\to\infty,\ 1\le \ell\le (1-\eta)\log\log N).
\end{equation}
\end{lem}

