 Let $v,\,w:M\to\R$ be sufficiently smooth observables. Then there is a constant
$C>0$ such that 
$$
\left|\int_M v \cdot (w\circ g_t)\,d\mu-\int_Mv\,d\mu\int_Mw\,d\mu\right|
