\end{theorem}
For skew-symmetric matrices, $(2)\Rightarrow(1)$ was proved in Assem and Yurikusa, “via categorification using Jacobian algebras.” A possible approach “by methods similar to those in \cite[Proposition~4.9]{A21}” had been suggested in Yurikusa, but lacked a complete proof. The paper claims to provide a complete proof “using scattering diagrams and their pull-back constructions.”

