    exists and equals $1$, and the logarithmic density of the set 
    \[\left\{x\ge 2\, :\, \left| \pi_{1/2}(x;q,a)-\pi_{1/2}(x;q,b) +\frac{\M(q;a,b)}{2\varphi(q)}\log \log x-C\right|\le \frac{1}{(\log x)^{1-\varepsilon}}\right\}\]
