\label{Mth}
		Let $N_r=S(\xi)$ be the total space of the sphere bundle of a 3-dimensional real vector bundle $\xi$ over $\mathbb{P}^2$ with $p_1(\xi)=r \omega$. Then
		\begin{enumerate}
