\label{thm:ANN}
If $p_1,p_2,q_1,q_2$ are nonnegative integers with $q_1, q_2$ even, $p_i\ge q_i$, and $p_1q_2-p_2q_1=\pm2$, then the disjoint union
\[
B_{p_1,q_1}\sqcup B_{p_2,q_2}\sqcup B_{p_1+p_2,q_1+q_2}
\]
admits a smooth orientation-preserving embedding in $\CPb$.

