open set with smooth enough boundary $\partial \Omega$. Let $q \in (0,1)$, let $2^{\star}_{Q}:=\tfrac{2Q}{Q-2}$ be the critical Sobolev exponent related to the Sobolev inequality in $\mathbb{G}$, and let $\lambda >0$. We consider the following Dirichlet boundary value problem
\begin{equation}\tag{{$\mathrm{P}$}}\label{EqProblem}
 \left\{\begin{array}{rll}
