This paper is organized as follows. We provide the preliminary notions on Bruhat-Tits building for $\operatorname{PGL}_3$ in Section~\ref{sec:2}. 
In Section~\ref{sec:3}, we deal with the fundamental domain of $\Gamma$ and the image of tailless galleries in the quotient space by the standard non-uniform lattice $\Gamma$ of $G$. In Section~\ref{sec:4}, we define the type 1 chamber zeta function for $\Gamma\backslash \mathcal{B}$ and prove that the zeta function satisfies the determinant formula. In Section \ref{sec:5}, we present the proof of Theorem \ref{thm:1.1} and Corollary \ref{coro:cycle_intro}.

