\begin{proposition}\label{le6}
Let $s>0$ be given. Let $(\overline{\phi },\overline{\psi })$ and $(\underline{\phi},\underline{\psi})$ be a pair of bounded upper and lower solutions of \eqref {TWS}. Then system \eqref {TWS} admits a positive solution $(\phi,\psi)$ of class $C^1(\R)$ such that
