    \[ \| T^\lambda g\|_{L^q(\mathbb{R}^{n-1} \times \{t\})}^q \lesssim_{\phi,q} |\supp\ g|^{\frac{q}{2}-1}\|g\|_2^q\]
    holds uniformly for all $t \in \mathbb{R}$. 
\end{lemma}
Two direct corollaries are
\begin{corollary} \label{essential constant decoupling}
