    \end{equation*}
    holds uniformly for all $f \in \mathcal{S}(\mathbb{R}^{n-1})$ with $\supp f \subset \mathbb{A}$ and all cubes $Q$ of sidelength $R^{1/2}$. 
\end{corollary}

