\subsection{Choice of Parameters} \(0 < \varepsilon \ll 1,\ 1 \leq R \leq \lambda,\ \
K = R^{\varepsilon^{50}},\ K_{\circ} = R^{\varepsilon^{100}},\ \kappa = R^{\varepsilon^{500}},\ 
