ref_dict.thm:size:
\begin{theorem}\label{thm:size}
Let $k$ be a positive integer.
If $G$ is a graph of order $n$ at least $2k+2$ without a $k$-degenerate cut, 
then the size of $G$ is at least 
$\frac{1}{2}\left(k+\frac{13\sqrt{k}}{190}-\frac{1}{38}\right)n$.
\end{theorem}

