    \label{cor:ascending_faithfully_affine}
    Consider \Cref{setup:fm_cube_pullback} where $t$ is affine, $f_1$ is locally projective, and $S$ is semiseparated. Let $K\in D^b_{\operatorname{coh}}(Y_1\times_S Y_2)$ be relatively perfect over each $Y_i$. If $\Phi_K$ restricts to a fully faithful functor (resp.\ an equivalence) on $D^b_{\operatorname{coh}}$, then so does $\Phi_{\mathbf{L}(t^\prime)^\ast K}$.
