Combining this with Wang and Zhu's result \cite{wang2025qualitativebehaviorbiharmonicfunctions}, we have the following corollary:

\begin{corollary}
    Let \(M\) be a Riemannian manifold with polynomial volume growth and Ricci curvature bounded below quadratically. Then for \(k, \ell \ge 0\) the spaces \(\mathcal{P}_{4k, 4\ell}(M)\) are finite dimensional.
