Let \( (M^4, g) \) be a closed, locally conformally flat, and scalar–flat \(4\)-manifold with \( \pi_2(M^4) \neq 0 \).  Then its Riemannian universal cover \( (\widetilde{M}, \tilde{g}) \) is isometric to $(\mathbb{H}^2  \times S^2 ,  g_{H} \oplus g_{st})$ up to homothety.
\end{theorem}

