The author acknowledges support from the Oberwolfach Leibniz Fellows programme (MFO), the YMSC Overseas Shuimu Scholarship, the Simons Center for Geometry and Physics, and ICMS Edinburgh (workshops on Geometric Measure Theory on Metric Spaces with Applications to Physics and Geometry and Geometric Moduli Spaces, respectively). I  thank Gerhard Huisken for discussions on the Ricci flow. This work originates from a broader project initiated during my postdoctoral stay at the Yau Center. During that time, this work was also supported by NSFC  12401063 and partially by  NSFC  12271284. I am deeply grateful to Shing-Tung Yau and Akito Futaki for their trust and support, which allowed me to pursue independent research.

