&\times\frac{c_{a,b}+c_{b,a}}{(ab)^{\frac12}}\frac{L(1,f)^2}{\zeta(2)} +O\left(q^{-\frac{1}{20}+\ve}a^{\frac{3}{10}}+q^{-\frac{1-2\theta_f}{22+16\theta_f}+\ve}b^{\frac{3+2\theta_f }{11+8\theta_f}}\r),
