\lim_{\epsilon\rightarrow 0^{+}}\epsilon \ln \mathbb{P}(\|u_{app}\|_{L_{t,x}^{\infty}([0,T_{\epsilon}]\times \mathbb{T})}>z_{0}\epsilon^{-\frac{1}{2}})=-\frac{z_{0}^{2}}{\sum_{n}c_{n}^{2}} 
