Let $\omega \in  W_{\mathrm{loc}}^{1,\frac{\mathbf{p}+2}{\mathbf{p}+1}}(\Omega) $ and let $u \in {W_{\mathrm{loc}}^{1,\mathbf{p}}}(\Omega)$ be a local minimizer of \eqref{functional} under assumptions \eqref{A2}--\eqref{A4}, with exponents $p_i\geq 2, \forall i=1,\dots,n $, such that
