and the following estimates
\begin{align*}
    &\sum_{i=1}^{n} \left(  \int_{B_{R/4}} |u_{x_i}|^{p_i +2 } dx \right) \notag\\
    &\leq c  \left( 1+\sum_{i=1}^{n} \left(\Vert u_{x_i} \Vert_{L^{p_i}(B_R)} + {\Vert \omega_{x_i} \Vert_{L^\frac{p_i+2}{p_i+1}(B_{R})}} \right) +\Vert \omega\Vert_{L^t(B_R)}+ \Vert g \Vert_{L^r (B_{R})} \right)^\sigma 
