    Let  $u_\varepsilon \in W^{1,p_n}_{\mathrm{loc}}(\Omega) $ be a local minimizer of the functional \eqref{functional2}.
    Then, 
    we have  $${V_{p_i}((u_\varepsilon)_{x_i})} \in W^{1,2}_{\mathrm{loc}}(\Omega), \quad \forall i =1,\dots, n.   $$

\end{lem}

