When $s=0$ we write $\mathbb{B}_T$ instead $\mathbb{B}_{0,T}$.
\item [viii.] Once understand the appropriate spaces in each situation, we will use the notations $g=(g_1,...,g_N)$ and $p=(p_1,...,p_N)$.
\end{itemize}

